- OPTION 1 installation via releases

For option one please install the .exe file in the releases section: https://github.com/geniusfred36/EasyScript/releases/tag/stable-release

- OPTION 2 installation via powershell

Please copy the following link into powershell: curl.exe -L "https://github.com/geniusfred36/EasyScript/releases/download/releases/EasyScript_1.0.3.exe" -o "EasyScript.exe"

To run the file via powershell simply type: .\EasyScript.exe

